expected_issues.description:
Potential NPE during sorting: comparator calls `o1.getTitle().compareTo(o2.getTitle())` without null checks. If any parsed guide has a null title (e.g., missing/invalid front matter), this will throw at runtime. Consider using `Comparator.nullsLast(String::compareTo)` or normalizing title to empty string during parsing/validation.

```suggestion
        Collections.sort(guides, (o1, o2) -> {
                    int p = Integer.compare(o1.getPriority(), o2.getPriority());
                    if (p != 0) {
                        return p;
                    }
                    return java.util.Comparator.nullsLast(String::compareTo)
                            .compare(o1.getTitle(), o2.getTitle());
                });
```

